WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:03.201
Unit one. What is a Computer!

2
00:00:04.148 --> 00:00:08.613
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:08.663 --> 00:00:12.188
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.238 --> 00:00:16.031
Today we learn about What is a Computer. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:21.206
Computer. Say it with me. Computer!

6
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.713
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

7
00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:36.150
Keyboard. Say it with me. Keyboard!

8
00:00:39.711 --> 00:00:43.411
Mouse. Say it with me. Mouse!

9
00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:50.668
Click. Say it with me. Click!

10
00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:58.588
Power button. Say it with me. Power button!

11
00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:06.043
Turn on. Say it with me. Turn on!

12
00:01:09.578 --> 00:01:13.484
Turn off. Say it with me. Turn off!

13
00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:30.398
A computer is a machine that helps us learn, play, and create. It has a screen, a keyboard, and a mouse. I press the power button to turn it on, and I know how to turn it off safely too.

14
00:01:30.448 --> 00:01:34.244
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.254 --> 00:01:40.663
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.713 --> 00:01:41.863
Keyboard!

17
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:48.354
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.404 --> 00:01:49.554
Turn on!

19
00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:58.344
Did you know? The first computers were as big as a whole room, but today a computer can fit in your pocket!

20
00:01:58.394 --> 00:02:00.758
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.623 --> 00:02:10.193
Think and answer. What is one thing you like to do on a computer?

22
00:02:10.243 --> 00:02:11.393
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.397 --> 00:02:17.924
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.974 --> 00:02:21.151
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

